(A computer-implemented document security system comprising an access request processor, a) Tj
T* (contextual risk assessment module, and an adaptive access control engine configured to) Tj
T* (evaluate access conditions and modify document access permissions in response to detected) Tj
T* (security risks.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 9 Tf
