(Problem Statement:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
170.0787401574803255 422.3624409448818255 Td
(Existing document-sharing systems may allow unauthorized users to access sensitive) Tj
T* (information when access permissions are improperly configured or user credentials are) Tj
T* (compromised. Conventional access control mechanisms may not respond dynamically to) Tj
T* (suspicious access patterns, increasing the risk of data leakage.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
42.5196850393700814 357.1655905511810261 Td
(Proposed Solution:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
170.0787401574803255 357.1655905511810261 Td
(The proposed system monitors document access requests and evaluates user permissions,) Tj
T* (device information, and access patterns. A risk assessment module identifies potentially) Tj
T* (unauthorized activity and dynamically applies access restrictions, additional verification, or) Tj
T* (access denial based on configurable security rules.) Tj
ET
BT
