T* (enforcement mechanism that adjusts document permissions in response to changing security) Tj
T* (conditions. A potential inventive contribution would be a specific technical mechanism for) Tj
T* (coordinating these components, such as a defined risk-update process, a novel) Tj
T* (policy-adjustment algorithm, or a measurable improvement in access-control performance.) Tj
